# Issue: SCC.tsort broke ties by Ord Id (string-intern order) or tournament
# tree shape, so let nesting in IConv, simple-def order in Simplify, and
# binding groups in TCheck reached the .bo in intern-dependent order.
# Fix: break topological-sort ties by input position and keep SCC neighbour
# lists in definition order.
# Probe: compare LetOrder.bo alone vs. behind LetOrderScramble and under
# -trace-intern-reverse.

batching_bo_pair LetOrder.bs LetOrderRoot.bs LetOrderScramble.bs
reverse_intern_same_bo LetOrder.bs
